                <head>Exportation of arms and munitions of war to Mexico, and exceptions
                    thereto</head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Note.</hi>—For the proclamation of February 3, 1914,
                    revoking the proclamation of March 14, 1912, see, in this volume, the
                    Secretary’s circular telegram of January 31, 1914, and the immediately following
                    proclamation (<ref target="#pg446">pp. 446</ref>–<ref target="#pg448"
                    >448</ref>). See also <ref target="frus:frus1913/pg_867">For. Rel. 1913, p.
                        867</ref>; and <ref target="frus:frus1912/pg_745">For. Rel. 1912, p.
                        745</ref>.</p>
